@startuml
title Digital Signal Timing

clock "System Clock" as CLK with period 20
binary "Reset" as RST
binary "Enable" as EN
concise "State" as STATE
robust "Output" as OUT

@0
RST is 1
EN is 0
STATE is Reset
OUT is Idle

@20
RST is 0
EN is 0
STATE is Idle
OUT is Idle

@40
EN is 1
STATE is Active
OUT is Running

@80
EN is 0
STATE is Idle
OUT is Done

@100
STATE is Idle
OUT is Idle
@enduml
